// Test: Possibility operator evidentiality propagation
// Spec: 11-HOLOGRAPHIC.md § 11.2.2 (Gap Analysis)
// Priority: P1 - Specification Compliance
//
// The ◊ operator should wrap results ∈ Predicted evidentiality.
// This test verifies the evidentiality is correctly propagated.
//
// @sdd_gap Section 11.2.2 - Possibility evidentiality missing
// @expected_behavior Result should have Predicted/◊ evidence marker

rite main() {
    // Test 1: Array extraction with possibility operator
    ≔ values = [1, 2, 3];
    ≔ result◊ = values|◊;  // Should extract with Predicted evidentiality

    // The result should be the first element (1)
    // AND should carry Predicted (◊) evidentiality
    println(result◊);

    // Test 2: Option extraction with possibility
    ≔ opt? = Some(42);
    ≔ extracted◊ = opt?|◊;  // Should extract with Predicted evidentiality
    println(extracted◊);
}
